      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "If Zizminarial ingests a soul gem from a cacodaemon, he can recover an expended spell slot instead of gaining fast healing. The spell slot's rank can be no higher than half the level of the creature whose soul was consumed, rounded up.\n\nZizminarial can ingest a soul from one of the 22 candles burning in this room to regain a spell slot of any level; he cannot use a soul candle to gain fast healing, though."
